From 21ce3c69f95f164d48154c541ea6251a0c4709d0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Jochen=20K=C3=BChner?= <jochen.kuehner@gmx.de>
Date: Wed, 1 Jul 2026 08:58:12 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] LibWeb: Implement CSSOM View GeometryUtils

Add the GeometryUtils mixin for Document, Element, and Text, including getBoxQuads() and the coordinate conversion methods. Follow the pending CSSOM View algorithm from w3c/csswg-drafts#10538; CSSPseudoElement remains deferred until that interface is exposed.

Add narrow C++ handles for the Rust-backed DOMQuad and DOMRectReadOnly geometry needed by the implementation. Preserve resolved flex auto margins in used-value cells so margin-box quads reflect the layout result.

Import focused cssom-getBoxQuads WPT coverage and update the CSSOM View IDL expectation.

Ported to Ladybird 759198723e8 using the Rust viewport mapping.
---

